WEBVTT

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:12.520
<i>Two days after the Sky Clan's bombardment,</i>

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.460
<i>a memorial and funeral service was held...</i>

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.300
<i>All I could do was hide my feelings,</i>

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:23.450
<i>and sit there as Nina Viento.</i>

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.360
We will now return the souls 
of these brave warriors

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.180
to Saint Aldista.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:36.170
Mirge Almodovar.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.010
Fernando Segarra.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:50.440
Cecilio Mendizabal.

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:57.930
Fausto Fidel Melze.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:04.600
Mitsuo Fukuhara.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.340
<i>Each time they called a name I knew,</i>

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:14.660
<i>a scream almost burst forth 
from my broken heart.</i>

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:18.140
Wolfgang Baumann.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.980
<i>I don't have the right to fly with everyone.</i>

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.810
<i>I won't. Not ever again.</i>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:06.290
<b>Episode 9: 
Your Name</b>

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:13.640
The brave children of Saint Aldista, 
who protected Isla, lie here.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:42.660
Bro...

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:49.020
Ari...

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.290
Is it okay for you to be out of the hospital?

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.120
Yeah, this is more important.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:18.900
Chiharu...

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:27.700
If only I'd run away when I should've, 
Mitty would still be...

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.730
That's not true...

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:33.030
You can't think that way, Chiharu.

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:35.910
Mitty died because I screwed up...

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:37.390
Stop it.

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:38.960
It's not your fault.

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:43.310
If you think that way, it'll make everyone sad.

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:44.120
But...

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:45.750
But...

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:49.310
After the battle was over,

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:53.280
the commander of the torpedo 
planes came to see me.

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:58.480
And he said I should tell 
you something once you were better.

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:03.700
"A medal is the only way the 
military can give its thanks.

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:09.710
But that medal expresses the 
gratitude of everyone on Isla,

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:11.350
including the torpedo squad.

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:16.240
Thank you. That flare was perfect.

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:19.160
Your partner was a wonderful pilot."

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.660
The Diet is waiting.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.580
Excuse me.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:51.680
We're busy.

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:52.330
Later...

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.180
Come in.

00:05:56.630 --> 00:06:00.100
The flight school students were 
there, so I couldn't leave it.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.100
I'm sorry about your son.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.400
My condolences.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.340
My son was a pilot.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.180
He would've wanted to die in the sky.

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:38.440
I'd like to begin the meeting.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:43.560
Admiral Luis, your thoughts on the battle, 
and on what we should do now.

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:46.850
It's likely that the Sky Clan predicted

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:49.490
where we'd be, and attacked us.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:53.710
If we keep going this way, 
there will be more difficult battles.

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:57.370
Right now, we cannot defeat them.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:01.520
We should consider the message left 
by the Holy Levamme Empire.

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:07.050
There's a possibility that if we join with 
them, we can fight the Sky Clan.

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:08.440
You're right.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:12.860
Our only option may be to rendezvous 
with them, and fight together.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:19.160
But we know nothing of them. 
Can they be trusted?

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:23.430
Levamme claims they are fighting the Sky Clan.

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:25.820
The enemy of my enemy is my friend.

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:30.770
A trite phrase, but valid enough 
for a short-term relationship.

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:34.120
In any event, we should change our heading

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:38.810
to avoid further ambushes, and leave 
the Holy Spring as soon as possible.

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:35.030
Claire...

00:08:37.940 --> 00:08:38.990
Kal-el...

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:44.830
Claire!

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:48.740
Claire!

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:49.770
Let me go!

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:50.920
I won't!

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:51.830
Please...

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:54.060
Look at me, Claire.

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:57.830
I'm so glad you're all right.

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:02.070
I'm quitting the flight school.

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:06.460
I don't have the right to be your classmate.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:09.510
No one blames you for not going out to fight.

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:12.010
No, that isn't it.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:14.730
I've been lying to everyone...

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.000
I'm sorry.

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:19.760
But you don't have to forgive me.

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:20.900
Claire...

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:23.600
I'm a coward.

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:25.080
Claire, what's gotten into you?

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:27.870
We shouldn't see each other anymore.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:36.130
You really think that?

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:39.830
I've wanted to see you so long!

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.240
So much!

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:44.430
Kal-el...

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:03.500
I love you.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.200
I don't want to let you go.

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:07.410
I want to be with you forever.

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:14.750
Why do you look so sad?

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:17.370
Claire?

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:22.100
Have we ever met before?

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:26.310
During the Wind Revolution...

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.320
There's something I need to know.

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:35.940
Are you...

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:37.940
What?

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:41.820
Are you Karl La Hire?

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:47.460
How did you...

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:52.180
I thought you might be.

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:52.830
I...

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:54.340
Claire...

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:59.050
I love you, so I'll never see you again.

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:02.280
Forget about me.

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:11.860
It's fine, Claire.

00:11:24.940 --> 00:11:27.580
Y-You're...

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:29.910
You...

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:33.330
You're Nina Viento!

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:35.650
Yes.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:40.500
I am Nina Viento.

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:42.430
Goodbye.

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:06.850
Are you not feeling well?

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.200
No, I'm fine.

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:13.230
I know this isn't the best time,

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:16.590
but there's something I'd like 
you to do as Nina Viento.

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:19.610
Many of the people are scared.

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:24.760
Many of them say it would be better 
to turn back than go forward.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:27.960
But the enemy is to our backs, as well.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:31.350
We have to continue our journey.

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:32.510
So...

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:33.580
I understand.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.150
I will fulfill my role as Nina.

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:42.240
Are you sure you're okay?

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:43.500
Yes.

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.060
Thank you for everything.

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:49.880
I'm done.

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:51.670
Are you sure?

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:52.580
Yeah.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:56.930
We're helping to rebuild the town 
today, so you should eat more.

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:59.040
Nanako, you haven't eaten anything, either.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.830
Neither have you, Sharon.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:03.480
I couldn't really sleep.

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:07.470
When night comes, I worry there 
could be another bombing...

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:10.500
I'm back!

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:12.300
Ari!

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:14.180
You're all eating breakfast?

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:16.650
Great! I'll join you.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.360
Are you sure, Ari?

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:21.070
You shouldn't be out of the 
hospital yet, should you?

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:24.050
More wounded are coming in every day.

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:27.190
I can't take up a nice bed like that.

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:28.820
My wounds have closed,

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:31.280
so I'm going to finish recovering here.

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:32.790
Where's Chiharu?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.910
She still isn't doing well.

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:37.670
She spends all her time by herself.

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:41.210
I see.

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.830
Kal isn't here, either...

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:46.930
He's been locked in his room for a while.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.770
He won't come out to help with the work.

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:50.180
He's acting kind of weird.

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:55.740
Kal, it's me.

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:57.080
I'm back.

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:00.450
At least answer me.

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:02.040
I'm coming in.

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:03.360
Don't.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.740
Just leave me alone!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.020
Ari...

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:12.450
How was Kal?

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:17.240
Just the way he used to be...

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:21.430
Like he hates everything in the world.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.650
Hey, there.

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:37.850
Thanks for helping.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.610
Not at all.

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:41.610
Is it okay for you to be up and about?

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:44.090
Yeah, I'm just fine.

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:47.500
I wonder what Admiral Luis is doing...

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:52.100
All this suffering, and he still 
wants to keep going?

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:55.590
We should head back.

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:56.580
That's right.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:59.250
We can load the island with 
soldiers and go back.

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:00.810
A carriage!

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:02.150
And horses, too!

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:03.620
Then, is that Nina?

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.550
Nina Viento is here?

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:09.420
Hey! Nina is giving a speech over there!

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:12.300
Hey, let me through!

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:15.300
I've never seen Nina up close...

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:16.430
Me, neither.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:22.750
It's a carriage...

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:24.950
Everyone, be quiet!

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:26.900
Get back!

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:29.120
It's Nina!

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:30.820
It's Nina!

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:30.820
It's Nina Viento!

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:33.530
Look at her golden crown!

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:34.790
She's so beautiful...

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:38.410
I can see why they call her 
the daughter of St. Aldista.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:41.080
Everyone, be quiet!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.940
The governor is going to give a speech.

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:47.280
Claire...

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:54.340
I am deeply moved by the sight of 
you working to restore your city.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.020
I shall do everything I can

00:15:56.020 --> 00:16:02.350
to restore the city of Centezual 
to its former glory.

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:06.130
I'm sure you're worried about 
what the future holds for us.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:10.360
But this journey is St. Aldista's will.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:15.650
We must endure this suffering, 
and continue toward the End of the Sky.

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:21.010
If we do, we will find the blessings of Aldista.

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:24.670
Let us work together to overcome these trials!

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:26.160
Nina!

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:27.090
Nina Viento!

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:35.650
<i>Kal, is this the reason you 
won't leave your room?</i>

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:37.470
Nina!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:38.680
Ari!

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:39.400
Get the carriage moving!

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:40.040
Wait!

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:41.250
Get back!

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:40.810
Claire!

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:43.280
Stop it.

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:46.810
Ignacio...

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.160
Push me.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:50.030
Quickly!

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.240
Claire!

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:58.010
Let's fly together again.

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:01.370
We all love you.

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:04.850
Stop it!

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:06.120
That is my friend.

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:07.530
Stand back.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:11.730
Nina!

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:13.100
It's Nina Viento!

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:14.220
I'm sorry.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.570
Claire.

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:18.030
I can't fly anymore.

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:20.970
I can't see anyone, not ever again.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:22.420
Not even Kal?

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:27.430
If he sees me, he'll surely suffer.

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.320
He'll remember the past.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.440
I'll handle Kal!

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:36.290
Goodbye.

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:38.530
Get back!

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:40.120
Clear the path!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.370
Nina!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.370
Bow to Nina Viento!

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:46.570
Ari, what's wrong?

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:47.720
Are you okay?

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:48.990
What was that about?

00:17:48.990 --> 00:17:50.960
It's nothing.

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:57.210
Kal, I brought your lunch.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:01.480
You don't need to eat?

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:03.010
At least drink some water.

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:06.210
Everyone's worried.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:12.270
I know something really bad 
happened to you before.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:14.550
And I can tell that something as bad...

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:20.770
No, even worse happened to you recently.

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:22.940
But listen...

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:25.590
Can I talk about Dad?

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:30.420
My dad had a boy who died as a baby.

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:35.530
We used to be really poor.

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:38.100
We couldn't even buy milk.

00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:42.670
My mom died just after I was born, right?

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:46.140
We didn't have the money 
to take her to a doctor.

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:49.110
Life was hard for everyone.

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:52.390
And that was part of what led to the revolution.

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:56.940
But my dad never complained.

00:18:57.470 --> 00:19:00.360
He had every right to hate the imperial family.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:03.300
But he took you in and raised you.

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:07.450
He gave you a lot of love,

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:10.330
taught you to fly...

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:13.380
So... I know it's hard,

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:16.230
but you're our dad's son.

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:19.800
So I know you can do what he did.

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:24.890
I'll leave lunch here.

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:27.520
If there's anything I can do,

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:28.810
just tell me.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:33.320
<i>Ariel...</i>

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:38.940
That was a wonderful speech.

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:43.450
Now everyone is united again, and we 
can continue to the End of the Sky.

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:49.870
Are you all right, Claire?

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:51.900
I'm fine.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:56.440
And stop calling me by that name.

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:59.030
I am Nina Viento.

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:01.060
I've given up that name.

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:07.430
Ari-men is really good.

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:09.140
Yeah...

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:12.430
Are you going to take that to Kal?

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:13.340
Yeah.

00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:14.650
The other is...

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:17.350
I'll take it.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:26.200
You need to eat, or you'll get sick.

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:28.300
RA...

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:40.130
Kal, I brought dinner.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:40.960
Want to eat?

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:46.260
Oh, right... I'll tell you.

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:50.640
I've decided to quit the flying school.

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:54.530
Even after I've healed,

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:57.540
I guess I won't be able to handle a throttle.

00:20:57.540 --> 00:21:01.670
So I spoke with the doctors 
and Mr. Bandereas,

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:03.930
and I'm going to be a mechanic.

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:08.660
I thought I'd tell you before I tell everyone else.

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:10.140
Move.

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:11.080
Igna?

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.890
No matter what I do after this,

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:14.290
don't interfere.

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:21.090
You're pathetic, Kal-el Albus.

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:29.410
I'm borrowing this idiot.

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:32.970
Ignacio!

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:35.820
That's a guard's uniform...

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:37.150
What's going on?

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:39.660
Are you sure we shouldn't stop him?

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:42.920
I don't really know,

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:45.220
but I think we can leave it to him.

00:21:53.340 --> 00:21:54.410
You...

00:23:31.660 --> 00:23:32.720
It's me, Ignacio.

00:23:33.030 --> 00:23:35.220
We have another mission.

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:38.910
I guess my luck really has run out 
if I have to fly behind him.

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:40.190
